gFieldNotesText_TreeckoMargin::
	.string "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Copied from the cave wall:\n"
	.string "Its kind still whet leaves\l"
	.string "on forest bark. This one\l"
	.string "came for the meteor. - S.$"

